title: "An Agent-Based Model for the Social Collapse of Calhoun's Universe 25 Experiment"
abstract: >-
  Code, simulation outputs and manuscripts of an agent-based model of the social collapse of
  J. B. Calhoun's Universe 25 experiment (1973), testing which local interaction rules reproduce it
  qualitatively against null models.
